reversal paths rebuilt with no filters at all, dropping it.

Nothing enforced it afterwards, so the query silently returned rows the
predicate excludes. `tests/flow/test_parser.py:test_complex` runs exactly
this shape but only asserts the query does not raise, so it never showed.

The filters cannot be rebuilt into the new scan subtree: they constrain the
