* fix: widen the edge-type matrix when a type is registered without an edge=
 (#3244)

get_type_id_mut registered a type and its tensor but did not resize
relationship_type_matrix, unlike get_relationship_matrix_mut and
get_label_id_mut. A type registered by GRAPH.CONSTRAINT on the primary or
