it): the deleted edge kept its type, and the edge reusing its id read
back with the old one.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 &lt;noreply@anthropic.com&gt;

* refactor: register relationship types through one helper that always resi=
zes

Both get_type_id_mut and get_relationship_matrix_mut pushed the type name,
inserted its tensor and resized relationship_type_matrix by hand; #3244 was
one of them forgetting the resize. register_relationship_type does all
three so no registration site can skip it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 &lt;noreply@anthropic.com&gt;

