<p dir=3D"auto">Our goal is to build a high-performance Knowledge Graph tai=
lored for Large Language Models (LLMs), prioritizing exceptionally low late=
ncy to ensure fast and efficient information delivery through our Graph Dat=
abase.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">=F0=9F=86=95 <a href=3D"https://www.falkordb.com/" rel=3D"n=
ofollow">FalkorDB</a> is the first <strong>queryable <a href=3D"https://git=
hub.com/opencypher/openCypher/blob/master/docs/property-graph-model.adoc">P=
roperty Graph</a> database to leverage sparse matrices</strong> for represe=
nting the <a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adjacency_matrix" rel=3D=
"nofollow">adjacency matrix</a> in graphs and <a href=3D"https://en.wikiped=
ia.org/wiki/Adjacency_matrix" rel=3D"nofollow">linear algebra</a> for query=
ing.</p>
<div class=3D"markdown-heading" dir=3D"auto"><h3 tabindex=3D"-1" class=3D"h=
eading-element" dir=3D"auto">Key Features</h3><a id=3D"user-content-key-fea=
