iv>
<ul dir=3D"auto">
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Sparse Matrix Representation</strong>: Utilizes spa=
rse matrices to represent adjacency matrices, optimizing storage and perfor=
mance.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Linear Algebra Querying</strong>: Employs linear al=
gebra for query execution, enhancing computational efficiency.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>Property Graph Model Compliance</strong>: Supports =
nodes and relationships with attributes, adhering to the Property Graph Mod=
el.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir=3D"auto"><strong>OpenCypher Support:</strong> Compatible with <a hre=
f=3D"https://github.com/opencypher/openCypher/blob/master/docs/property-gra=
ph-model.adoc">OpenCypher</a> query language, including proprietary extensi=
ons for advanced querying capabilities.</p>
</li>
</ul>
