<p dir=3D"auto">This repository is the Rust implementation of FalkorDB. It =
builds the <code>falkordb</code> Redis
module (<code>libfalkordb.{so,dylib}</code>) from Rust, using GraphBLAS spa=
rse matrices for graph
storage and traversal.</p>
