<p dir=3D"auto">The script auto-detects the libomp source release from <cod=
e>${CC:-clang} --version</code>, so it stays ABI-matched to your compiler w=
ith no manual
version arg. In Docker the same auto-detection runs against
<code>clang-${CLANG_MAJOR}</code>, eliminating the prior drift risk between=
